  - that the sample `[120, 90, 2400, 400, 8000]` gives `[60, 45, 3000, 400, 12000]`, in order;
  - that fractions stay unrounded (`1801` gives `2251.25`);
  - that an empty list gives `[]`;
  - that a negative size throws a `RangeError`.

